# EdSteward Branding

## Brand Colors

| Name | Hex | RGB | Usage |
|------|-----|-----|-------|
| EdSteward Purple (primary) | `#2e1b68` | `46, 27, 104` | Primary brand color, buttons, headers, hero sections |
| Dark Purple (secondary) | `#1a0f3d` | `26, 15, 61` | Gradients, dark accents |
| Accent Purple | `#6b3fa0` | `107, 63, 160` | Accent lines, highlights |
| White | `#ffffff` | `255, 255, 255` | Backgrounds, text on purple |

## Logo

The current EdSteward logo is the **ES lettermark** (no shield): `/assets/es-logo-pdf.png`

Use this logo for:
- Login page
- PDF reports (HECVAT, compliance docs)
- Default tenant branding fallback

## Login Page

- **Form side**: white background (`#ffffff`)
- **Hero side**: EdSteward purple gradient (`#2e1b68` to `#1a0f3d`)
